<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>private-labels</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/cut-and-sew.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/polos.css">
</head>

<body>
     <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="hero-bg-container">
            <img src="../photos/private-labels.webp" alt="Vito and Will folded polo shirts" class="hero-image">
        </div>

    </section>
    <section class="manufacturing-services">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Private Label Clothing Manufacturing</h2>

            <p class="section-text">
                At Wuzwear Industry, we specialize in catering to every type of private label clothing requirement. With
                years of expertise and substantial experience in private label manufacturing, we not only produce
                high-quality blank products but also provide a wide range of customization services. Our clients span
                across Australia, Canada, UAE, UK, and the USA.




            </p>

            <p class="section-text">
                Through our Custom Cut and Sew Manufacturing Services, we handle everything from sourcing fabric
                according to your specifications to delivering fully finished products. Whether you are starting from
                scratch or scaling an established brand, we manage every stage with precision and care—right up to
                doorstep delivery.




            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="service-row">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/private-labels1.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Best Private Label Apparel Manufacturing to Outshine the Competition</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        At Wuzwear Industry, we believe true success lies in brand loyalty and long-term stability. To
                        help you stay ahead of the competition, we offer premium private label manufacturing solutions
                        that enhance your brand’s identity.



                    </p>
                    <p>With our extensive capabilities, you can expand your clothing line quickly, minimize costs, and
                        maximize return on investment. We also provide customization options such as branded hangtags
                        and labels, ensuring your brand stands apart in a crowded marketplace.

                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row row-reverse">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/private-labels2.webp" alt="Tailor working with denim fabric at a workbench">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Develop a Private Label Clothing Line to Impress Your Audience</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        We are among the leading private label clothing suppliers in the USA. No matter your
                        requirements, we provide the right solutions to elevate your brand image.




                    </p>
                    <p>Our services include high-quality private label clothing with custom hangtags, woven labels,
                        satin labels, and heat transfer labels. With our flexibility and expertise, you gain endless
                        options to create a collection that your customers will remember.



                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="dye-services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="dye-row">
                <div class="dye-image">
                    <img src="../photos/private-labels3.webp" alt="Colorful sublimated and dyed athletic t-shirts">
                </div>
                <div class="dye-content">
                    <h2 class="dye-title">Custom Woven Labels</h2>
                    <p class="dye-text">
                        Woven labels are perfect for showcasing your brand name, logo, or size. They add a premium touch
                        to garments and can be stitched at the neck or any preferred location.


                    </p>
                    <p>Minimum production: 500 woven labels


                    </p>
                    <p>Stitching included at no extra cost</p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="dye-row row-reverse">
                <div class="dye-image">
                    <img src="../photos/private-labels4.webp"
                        alt="A collection of vibrant fabric color swatches arranged together">
                </div>
                <div class="dye-content">
                    <h2 class="dye-title">Custom Satin Labels</h2>
                    <p class="dye-text">
                        Satin labels are soft and comfortable, making them ideal for garments worn close to the skin,
                        such as t-shirts. They come in white, black, cream, and grey, with one or two ink colors for
                        printing.


                    </p>
                    <p>Minimum production: 500 satin labels


                    </p>
                    <p>Fully customizable (material color, ink color, font size, font style, label size</p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="service-row">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/private-labels5.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Custom Hangtags</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        Hangtags serve as a powerful marketing tool to attract customers in retail spaces. We offer
                        custom hangtags in any shape or size, complete with punched holes and string options.

                    </p>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        Minimum production: 500 hangtags
                    </p>
                    <p>We store extras for use in future orders</p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>
    </section>6


    <%- include('partials/popup') %>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>


